Enigma-PD-WML Licence
=====================

Summary
-------

The source code in this repository is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License
(Part 1 below).

However, this pipeline cannot run without two third-party components, FSL and
UNet-pgs, which are NOT covered by the BSD 3-Clause License and are restricted
to non-commercial and academic research use (Part 2 below). The pipeline as a
whole, including the Docker image built from this repository, may therefore
only be used for non-commercial purposes, unless separate permission is
obtained for each of these components.


